lass="zp raw-3787380"> <div class="zp ra-3787380 center-xs flex-row"> <div class="zpa-flex--column zpa-flex xs-12 sm-6 lg-6 md-6"> <div class="zp ca-7718671"> <div class="zpa-position--relative zp mcwa-13264986 zpa-el-image"> <div class="zp zpa-image-container mca-13264986" data-id="13264986"> <img width="800" height="801" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw,3840px,2048px,1940px,1680px,1536px,1376px,1080px,840px,540px" srcset="https://cdn05.zipify.com/tZY3x6LqC0p9AjaUXZp7FpoTiYQ=/fit-in/540x0/2522648dde6143149a8431594b52dc68/take_kare_jnspj__mathilde_villemejeanne-78-copie.jpeg 540w, https://cdn05.zipify.com/H2RmqgqfFiIWPnsdyQGpgIF-YqM=/fit-in/840x0/2522648dde6143149a8431594b52dc68/take_kare_jnspj__mathilde_villemejeanne-78-copie.jpeg 840w, https://cdn05.zipify.com/3ZBO2b6O2pqOAxhpGTfbTx3NUPg=/fit-in/1080x0/2522648dde6143149a8431594b52dc68/take_kare_jnspj__mathilde_villemejeanne-78-copie.jpeg 1080w, https://cdn05.zipify.com/3QOuyqgeMaCKl7K_SvxcQxP1ncI=/fit-in/1376x0/2522648dde6143149a8431594b52dc68/take_kare_jnspj__mathilde_villemejeanne-78-copie.jpeg 1376w, https://cdn05.zipify.com/NomhMiR2E7SUVq7ivFM7fW9iyKo=/fit-in/1536x0/2522648dde6143149a8431594b52dc68/take_kare_jnspj__mathilde_villemejeanne-78-copie.jpeg 1536w, https://cdn05.zipify.com/Vp4JoLRwTlArhspeYclK_CqBW6g=/fit-in/1680x0/2522648dde6143149a8431594b52dc68/take_kare_jnspj__mathilde_villemejeanne-78-copie.jpeg 1680w, https://cdn05.zipify.com/Bj1jiaPmTGBqu49l2BOVLdXXFeg=/fit-in/1940x0/2522648dde6143149a8431594b52dc68/take_kare_jnspj__mathilde_villemejeanne-78-copie.jpeg 1940w, https://cdn05.zipify.com/d7gGqevM2ZgV9P-GvNAHA22is3w=/fit-in/2048x0/2522648dde6143149a8431594b52dc68/take_kare_jnspj__mathilde_villemejeanne-78-copie.jpeg 2048w, https://cdn05.zipify.com/gdkhpLM6x2oTvoRDP2mjgag5hkM=/fit-in/3840x0/2522648dde6143149a8431594b52dc68/take_kare_jnspj__mathilde_villemejeanne-78-copie.jpeg 3840w" src="https://cdn05.zipify.com/gdkhpLM6x2oTvoRDP2mjgag5hkM=/fit-in/3840x0/2522648dde6143149a8431594b52dc68/take_kare_jnspj__mathilde_villemejeanne-78-copie.jpeg" class="zpa-img-fluid zp eswb-13264986 ea-13264986 zpa-lazyload" data-lowsrc="https://cdn05.zipify.com/JCX1Xdr2kP6Xb2gMhhAnLuVCZ2U=/fit-in/3840x0/filters:quality(20)/2522648dde6143149a8431594b52dc68/take_kare_jnspj__mathilde_villemejeanne-78-copie.jpeg" data-parent-fit="contain" data-src="https://cdn05.zipify.com/gdkhpLM6x2oTvoRDP2mjgag5hkM=/fit-in/3840x0/2522648dde6143149a8431594b52dc68/take_kare_jnspj__mathilde_villemejeanne-78-copie.jpeg"> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="zpa-flex--column zpa-flex xs-12 sm-6 lg-6 md-6"> <div class="zp ca-7718672"> <div class="zpa-word-wrap disable-internal-link zpa-el-text zp ea-11847465"> <h3 class="zp ts-h3 tsl-1">On te promet</h3> <p class="zp ts-regular-1"><br></p> <ul class="zp ts-regular-1 zpa-text__list zpa-text__list--disc"> <li class="zp tsl-4"> <p class="zp ts-regular-1 tsl-5"><span class="zp tsl-6">Que tu sauras quoi mettre en place pour débuter ton aventure entrepreneuriale dans les </span><span class="zp tsl-7">meilleures conditions</span><span class="zp tsl-8"> (sans stress, sans précipitation)</span></p> </li> <li class="zp tsl-9"> <p class="zp ts-regular-1 tsl-10"><span class="zp tsl-11">Que tu poseras les </span><span class="zp tsl-12">fondations</span><span class="zp tsl-13"> de ton projet et </span><span class="zp tsl-14">structureras</span><span class="zp tsl-15"> </span><span class="zp tsl-16">ta vision </span><span class="zp tsl-17">pour atteindre tes objectifs</span></p> </li> <li class="zp tsl-18"> <p class="zp ts-regular-1 tsl-19"><span class="zp tsl-20">Que tu ne perdras plus ton temps à chercher des infos partout, tu iras</span><span class="zp tsl-21"> directement à </span><span class="zp tsl-22">l’essentiel</span><span class="zp tsl-23"> en disposant de toutes les infos dont tu as besoin, au même endroit</span></p> </li> <li class="zp tsl-24"> <p class="zp ts-regular-1 tsl-25"><span class="zp tsl-26">Que tu </span><span class="zp tsl-27">passeras à l’action rapidement</span><span class="zp tsl-28"> et auras toutes les cartes en main pour mettre en route ton projet professionnel </span></p> <p class="zp ts-regular-1 tsl-29"><br></p> </li> </ul> <p class="zp ts-regular-1 tsl-30"><span class="zp tsl-31">Prête à concrétiser ton idée de dingue ?</span></p> <p class="zp ts-regular-1 tsl-33"><br></p> </div> <div class="zp bsw-primary eat-13264982 zpa-el-button" data-id="13264982"> <a href="#15010209" data-type="cluster_dest" target="_self" role="button" class="zp ea-13264982 zpa-btn-custom bs-primary bhl"> JE ME LANCE ! </a> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section> <section class="js-cluster-wrapper zpa-cross-part-image-right-112-v1-dynamic zpa-cross-part-image-right-112 zpa-is-new-structure zp ba-15010218" data-id="15010218" id="15010218"> <div class="js-cluster zp cac-15010218"> <div class="zp raw-3787387"> <div class="zp ra-3787387 center-xs flex-row"> <div class="zpa-flex--column zpa-flex xs-12 sm-6 lg-6 md-6"> <div class="zp ca-7718682"> <div class="zpa-word-wrap disable-internal-link zpa-el-text zp ea-11847475"> <h2 class="zp ts-h2 tsl-1">Le programme </h2> <p class="zp ts-regular-1 tsl-3"><br></p> <p class="zp ts-regular-1 tsl-4"><span class="zp tsl-5">Les modules : </span><span class="zp tsl-6">Mindset - Opérationnel - Outils</span></p> <p class="zp ts-regular-1 tsl-7"><br></p> <p class="zp ts-regular-1 tsl-8"><span class="zp tsl-9">Le contenu : </span><span class="zp tsl-10">28 vidéos 100% conseils</span></p> <p class="zp ts-regular-1 tsl-11"><br></p> <p class="zp ts-regular-1 tsl-12"><span class="zp tsl-13">Les exercices :</span><span class="zp tsl-14">  7 exercices pratiques à remplir, le tout rassemblé dans un PDF remplissable en ligne</span></p> <p class="zp ts-regular-1 tsl-16"><br></p> <p class="zp ts-regular-1 tsl-17"><span class="zp tsl-18">Durée estimée : </span><span class="zp tsl-19">compte environ</span><span class="zp tsl-20"> </span><span class="zp tsl-21">1 mois à partir du début du programme, en gardant un </span><span class="zp tsl-22">bon rythme</span><span class="zp tsl-23"> et en étant régulière. Pas de panique, </span><span class="zp tsl-24">aucune limite de temps n’est imposée.</span></p> <p class="zp ts-regular-1 tsl-26"><br></p> <p class="zp ts-regular-1 tsl-28"><br></p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="zpa-flex--column zpa-flex xs-12 sm-6 lg-6 md-6"> <div class="zp ca-7718683"> <div class="zpa-position--relative zp mcwa-11847476 zpa-el-image"> <div class="zp zpa-image-container mca-11847476" data-id="11847476"> <img width="1080" height="1080" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw,3840px,2048px,1940px,1680px,1536px,1376px,1080px,840px,540px" srcset="https://cdn05.zipify.com/TSijDxfw6vm3V31ru0GYr8vLHqU=/fit-in/540x0/2b2382747ee6430387d817dcb6a2b3ca/design-sans-titre-4.png 540w, https://cdn05.zipify.com/elVdDoLjAe0z2-uwc0Vtv3Yb1fw=/fit-in/840x0/2b2382747ee6430387d817dcb6a2b3ca/design-sans-titre-4.png 840w, https://cdn05.zipify.com/QdpgxKWGFs_AZtNj4RebBPeueuM=/fit-in/1080x0/2b2382747ee6430387d817dcb6a2b3ca/design-sans-titre-4.png 1080w, https://cdn05.zipify.com/VwavwMtQm0viJekLQOyS9wGJqII=/fit-in/1376x0/2b2382747ee6430387d817dcb6a2b3ca/design-sans-titre-4.png 1376w, https://cdn05.zipify.com/bAZxFQn-deLTZNVbK3HuABhJBgE=/fit-in/1536x0/2b2382747ee6430387d817dcb6a2b3ca/design-sans-titre-4.png 1536w, https://cdn05.zipify.com/WiZyZf12zjoAa8LPQhcM6rkiErk=/fit-in/1680x0/2b2382747ee6430387d817dcb6a2b3ca/design-sans-titre-4.png 1680w, https://cdn05.zipify.com/yExeA_jwVgDW01Du4NzdYsiccEU=/fit-in/1940x0/2b2382747ee6430387d817dcb6a2b3ca/design-sans-titre-4.png 1940w, https://cdn05.zipify.com/eAzX72qv4YLUsg9XbEkKypVmavM=/fit-in/2048x0/2b2382747ee6430387d817dcb6a2b3ca/design-sans-titre-4.png 2048w, https://cdn05.zipify.com/GLcD_N9LdEbvy-_71_SzRjS4gyY=/fit-in/3840x0/2b2382747ee6430387d817dcb6a2b3ca/design-sans-titre-4.png 3840w" src="https://cdn05.zipify.com/GLcD_N9LdEbvy-_71_SzRjS4gyY=/fit-in/3840x0/2b2382747ee6430387d817dcb6a2b3c